). g and b differ by about 0.1 on the shoulder (D above 2.7), then run so close that their dashes share one ink band from log H about -1.7 to -1.25 (separated by 0.03 in the hints only; the trace may not tell them apart there); below log H -1.25 all three coincide within about 0.02 and are traced alike. The curves end at log H 1.0 (frame edge), D-min plateau about 0.134.","sensitivity: y is relative log sensitivity as printed (sensitivity = reciprocal of the exposure in J/cm2 giving the specified density, which the sheet states as 1.0 above D-min). Curves are drawn only between about -0.7 and the peak on each side, from 395-522 nm (b), 482-602 nm (g), 550-690 nm (r); the trace is on a 5 nm grid, so the last 0-4 nm at each end are cut.","dyes: spectral diffuse density of the separated dyes as printed (maximum 1.0 each). Curves start at about 394 nm (yellow 396) and end near 710 nm (cyan, D 0.29); yellow is not traced beyond 555 nm and magenta beyond 660 nm where they join the base line (about 0.01). Cyan and magenta cross near 440 nm (both about 0.035): the upper-left curve at 394 nm is cyan, the lower one magenta; yellow/magenta cross near 493 nm, yellow/cyan near 524 nm, magenta/cyan near 590 nm (D 0.43)."],"dyes":{"y":[[395.0,0.6042],[400.0,0.6333],[405.0,0.6804],[410.0,0.7314],[415.0,0.7817],[420.0,0.8313],[425.0,0.8791],[430.0,0.9216],[435.0,0.9579],[440.0,0.9842],[445.0,0.9947],[450.0,0.9867],[455.0,0.9555],[460.0,0.9066],[465.0,0.8401],[470.0,0.7602],[475.0,0.6687],[480.0,0.5688],[485.0,0.4674],[490.0,0.3767],[495.0,0.3046],[500.0,0.2398],[505.0,0.1835],[510.0,0.1395],[515.0,0.1075],[520.0,0.0824],[525.0,0.0586],[530.0,0.0455],[535.0,0.0331],[540.0,0.0234],[545.0,0.0166],[550.0,0.0136],[555.0,0.0136]],"m":[[395.0,0.04],[400.0,0.035],[405.0,0.031],[410.0,0.0279],[415.0,0.0257],[420.0,0.0249],[425.0,0.0249],[430.0,0.0264],[435.0,0.0307],[440.0,0.0347],[445.0,0.0429],[450.0,0.0511],[455.0,0.0625],[460.0,0.0785],[465.0,0.099],[470.0,0.1253],[475.0,0.1564],[480.0,0